message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "Agent Gorgon: runtime policy guard for autonomous AI agents"
abstract: "Agent Gorgon is a user-space runtime policy guard for autonomous AI agents. It applies deterministic policy to process-tree observations, attempts SIGSTOP or SIGKILL controls for configured triggers, and records evidence without claiming complete visibility or attribution."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Bosch Rodriguez"
    given-names: "Rolando"
